<title>USA: Polaroid names manager of Russian business.</title>
<headline>Polaroid names manager of Russian business.</headline>
<dateline>CAMBRIDGE, Mass. 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polaroid Corp said Monday it named Arthur Braunstein as general manager of its business in Russia.</p>
<p>For the past two years, Braunstein, 45, has been managing director in charge of AT&amp;T Corp's business in the Commonwealth of Independent States.</p>
<p>Braunstein replaces George Marquart, who after seven years is returning to the U.S. to work in Polaroid's Identification Systems group, a spokesman said.</p>
<p>((Boston bureau, (617) 367-4106))</p>
